@cindex package-local nicknames
@partofpln

Remove the @termref{package-local nickname} @var{local-nickname} from
@var{package} and return @emph{true} if @var{package} has been changed
and @code{nil} otherwise.

@var{local-nickname} is a @spectermrefl{string_designator,string
designator} that represents the local nickname to be removed from
@var{package}.  @var{package}
@spectermrefl{package_designator,designator} for a package object from
which @var{local-nickname} is to be removed.  If @var{package} is not
supplied, the current value of @varref{*package*,@toppackage{}} is used
instead.

If @var{local-nickname} is the @termref{package-local nickname} of any
package in @var{package}, then it is removed, and this function returns
@emph{true}.  If @var{nickname} is not the @termref{package-local
nickname} of any package in @var{package}, then this function has no
effect, and returns @code{nil}.

